{"slug":"count-and-say","id":38,"title":"Count and Say","difficulty":"Easy","tags":[],"fn":"countAndSay","params":[["n","int"]],"types":["int"],"ret":"string","cmp":"exact","desc":"<p><strong>外觀數列</strong>（Look-and-Say sequence）是一個整數序列，從數字 <code>1</code> 開始，序列中的每一項都是對前一項的描述。</p>\n<p>前五項如下：</p>\n<pre><code>1.     1\n2.     11\n3.     21\n4.     1211\n5.     111221</code></pre>\n                <p><code>1</code> 被讀作 <code>\"one 1\"</code> (<code>\"一個一\"</code>) , 即 <code>11</code>。</p>\n<p><code>11</code> 被讀作 <code>\"two 1s\"</code> (<code>\"兩個一\"</code>), 即 <code>21</code>。</p>\n<p><code>21</code> 被讀作 <code>\"one 2\"</code>, <code>\"one 1\"</code> (<code>\"一個二\"</code>, <code>\"一個一\"</code>) , 即 <code>1211</code>。</p>\n<p>給定一個正整數 <code>n</code>，輸出外觀數列的第 <code>n</code> 項。</p>","constraints":["1 <= n <= 30"],"starter":{"python":"class Solution:\n    def countAndSay(self, n: int) -> str:\n        ","typescript":"function countAndSay(n: number): string {\n    \n};","javascript":"/**\n * @param {number} n\n * @return {string}\n */\nvar countAndSay = function(n) {\n    \n};","c":"char* countAndSay(int n) {\n    \n}","cpp":"class Solution {\npublic:\n    string countAndSay(int n) {\n        \n    }\n};"},"examples":[{"args":[1],"out":"1"},{"args":[4],"out":"1211"}],"tests":[{"args":[1],"out":"1"},{"args":[2],"out":"11"},{"args":[3],"out":"21"},{"args":[4],"out":"1211"},{"args":[5],"out":"111221"},{"args":[6],"out":"312211"},{"args":[7],"out":"13112221"},{"args":[8],"out":"1113213211"},{"args":[9],"out":"31131211131221"},{"args":[10],"out":"13211311123113112211"},{"args":[11],"out":"11131221133112132113212221"},{"args":[12],"out":"3113112221232112111312211312113211"},{"args":[13],"out":"1321132132111213122112311311222113111221131221"},{"args":[14],"out":"11131221131211131231121113112221121321132132211331222113112211"},{"args":[15],"out":"311311222113111231131112132112311321322112111312211312111322212311322113212221"},{"args":[16],"out":"132113213221133112132113311211131221121321131211132221123113112221131112311332111213211322211312113211"},{"args":[17],"out":"11131221131211132221232112111312212321123113112221121113122113111231133221121321132132211331121321231231121113122113322113111221131221"},{"args":[18],"out":"31131122211311123113321112131221123113112211121312211213211321322112311311222113311213212322211211131221131211132221232112111312111213111213211231131122212322211331222113112211"},{"args":[19],"out":"1321132132211331121321231231121113112221121321132122311211131122211211131221131211132221121321132132212321121113121112133221123113112221131112311332111213122112311311123112111331121113122112132113213211121332212311322113212221"},{"args":[20],"out":""},{"args":[21],"out":""},{"args":[22],"out":""},{"args":[23],"out":""},{"args":[24],"out":""},{"args":[25],"out":""},{"args":[26],"out":""},{"args":[27],"out":""},{"args":[28],"out":""},{"args":[29],"out":""},{"args":[30],"out":""}],"ref":"// 逐輪描述：統計連續相同字元的個數\n// 時間複雜度: O(n × L)，L 為字串長度；空間複雜度: O(L)\nfunction countAndSay(n) {\n    let s = '1';\n    for (let k = 1; k < n; k++) {\n        let next = '';\n        for (let i = 0; i < s.length;) {\n            let j = i;\n            while (j < s.length && s[j] === s[i])\n                j++;\n            next += (j - i) + s[i]; // 個數 + 字元\n            i = j;\n        }\n        s = next;\n    }\n    return s;\n}\n","solutions":{"python":"class Solution:\n    def countAndSay(self, n: int) -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        迭代生成法\n        時間複雜度: O(n * m)，m 是字串長度\n        空間複雜度: O(m)\n        \"\"\"\n        result = \"1\"\n        \n        # 迭代 n-1 次\n        for _ in range(n - 1):\n            result = self.getNext(result)\n        \n        return result\n    \n    def getNext(self, s: str) -> str:\n        \"\"\"生成下一項\"\"\"\n        result = []\n        i = 0\n        \n        while i < len(s):\n            char = s[i]\n            count = 1\n            \n            # 統計連續相同字符\n            while i + 1 < len(s) and s[i + 1] == char:\n                count += 1\n                i += 1\n            \n            # 說出 \"個數 + 字符\"\n            result.append(str(count) + char)\n            i += 1\n        \n        return ''.join(result)\n    \n    def countAndSay_v2(self, n: int) -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        使用 itertools.groupby\n        \"\"\"\n        from itertools import groupby\n        \n        result = \"1\"\n        \n        for _ in range(n - 1):\n            result = ''.join(str(len(list(group))) + digit \n                           for digit, group in groupby(result))\n        \n        return result","cpp":"#include <string>\nusing namespace std;\n\nclass Solution {\npublic:\n    string countAndSay(int n) {\n        string result = \"1\";\n        \n        // 迭代 n-1 次\n        for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n            result = getNext(result);\n        }\n        \n        return result;\n    }\n    \nprivate:\n    string getNext(const string& s) {\n        string result = \"\";\n        int i = 0;\n        \n        while (i < s.length()) {\n            char digit = s[i];\n            int count = 1;\n            \n            // 統計連續相同字符\n            while (i + 1 < s.length() && s[i + 1] == digit) {\n                count++;\n                i++;\n            }\n            \n            // 說出 \"個數 + 字符\"\n            result += to_string(count) + digit;\n            i++;\n        }\n        \n        return result;\n    }\n};","java":"class Solution {\n    public String countAndSay(int n) {\n        String result = \"1\";\n        \n        // 迭代 n-1 次\n        for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n            result = getNext(result);\n        }\n        \n        return result;\n    }\n    \n    private String getNext(String s) {\n        StringBuilder result = new StringBuilder();\n        int i = 0;\n        \n        while (i < s.length()) {\n            char digit = s.charAt(i);\n            int count = 1;\n            \n            // 統計連續相同字符\n            while (i + 1 < s.length() && s.charAt(i + 1) == digit) {\n                count++;\n                i++;\n            }\n            \n            // 說出 \"個數 + 字符\"\n            result.append(count).append(digit);\n            i++;\n        }\n        \n        return result.toString();\n    }\n}","typescript":"// 逐輪描述：統計連續相同字元的個數\n// 時間複雜度: O(n × L)，L 為字串長度；空間複雜度: O(L)\nfunction countAndSay(n: number): string {\n    let s = '1';\n    for (let k = 1; k < n; k++) {\n        let next = '';\n        for (let i = 0; i < s.length; ) {\n            let j = i;\n            while (j < s.length && s[j] === s[i]) j++;\n            next += (j - i) + s[i];           // 個數 + 字元\n            i = j;\n        }\n        s = next;\n    }\n    return s;\n}\n","c":"// 逐輪描述：統計連續相同字元的個數（n ≤ 30 時長度約 4500）\n// 時間複雜度: O(n × L)，空間複雜度: O(L)\nchar* countAndSay(int n) {\n    int cap = 5000;\n    char* cur = malloc(cap);\n    char* next = malloc(cap);\n    strcpy(cur, \"1\");\n\n    for (int k = 1; k < n; k++) {\n        int len = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; cur[i]; ) {\n            int j = i;\n            while (cur[j] == cur[i]) j++;\n            next[len++] = '0' + (j - i);     // 個數（最多 3，單一位數）\n            next[len++] = cur[i];\n            i = j;\n        }\n        next[len] = '\\0';\n        char* tmp = cur; cur = next; next = tmp;\n    }\n    free(next);\n    return cur;\n}\n"},"cDriver":"int main(void) {\n    char *lc_buf = lc_read_all(); const char *lc_p = lc_buf;\n    int lc_n = (int)strtol(lc_p, (char **)&lc_p, 10);\n    for (int lc_i = 0; lc_i < lc_n; lc_i++) {\n        LJ *lc_c = lj_parse(&lc_p);\n        lc_start(lc_i);\n        LB lc_o = {0};\n        double lc_t0, lc_ms;\n        int a0 = lcc_int(&lc_c->a[0]);\n        lc_t0 = lc_now();\n        char* lc_r = countAndSay(a0);\n        lc_ms = lc_now() - lc_t0;\n        lb_str(&lc_o, lc_r);\n        lc_result(lc_i, lc_ms, &lc_o);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}","cppDriver":"int main() {\n    char *lc_buf = lc_read_all(); const char *lc_p = lc_buf;\n    int lc_n = (int)strtol(lc_p, (char **)&lc_p, 10);\n    for (int lc_i = 0; lc_i < lc_n; lc_i++) {\n        LJ *lc_c = lj_parse(&lc_p);\n        lc_start(lc_i);\n        LB lc_o = {0};\n        double lc_t0, lc_ms;\n        int a0 = lcx::from<int>(&lc_c->a[0]);\n        Solution *lc_sol = new Solution();\n        lc_t0 = lc_now();\n        auto lc_r = lc_sol->countAndSay(a0);\n        lc_ms = lc_now() - lc_t0;\n        lcx::put(&lc_o, lc_r);\n        lc_result(lc_i, lc_ms, &lc_o);\n    }\n    return 0;\n}"}